@baseUrl = https://your-app.test
@tenantId = your-tenant-id

### Create Contact Message (Public - Tenant Website)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant-website/{{tenantId}}/contact-messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "contact_form_section",
  "customer_name": "أحمد محمد",
  "customer_email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "customer_phone": "+966501234567",
  "message": "أرغب في التواصل بخصوص عقار",
  "metadata": {
    "page_slug": "contact",
    "locale": "ar"
  }
}
